SAP PM + ABAP Interview Cheatsheet
Target Role: Custom Software Engineer
Focus: SAP Plant Maintenance (PM) + ABAP Development for HANA

1) 30-Second Introduction
“I'm a SAP PM techno-functional professional with 8+ years of experience in manufacturing and plant maintenance environments. My core expertise includes SAP PM process design, equipment master, functional locations, preventive maintenance, work orders, breakdown workflows, master data migration, UAT, and SAP PM integration with MM and external plant systems. Along with functional expertise, I also have ABAP experience in reports, enhancements, interfaces, validations, and HANA-oriented development. I’ve worked on large-scale multi-site implementations, custom RICEFW objects, and business-driven automation that improved uptime, response time, and process efficiency.”

